          "guid": "mtozqxf85b6x2to5",
          "message": {
            "text": "Wait for analysis to settle before measuring the browse cursor target, so the composited cursor lands on the file the click actually opens.\n\nIn risk sort mode the sidebar re-sorts as mock scores stream in, and the .analysis-loading-inline banner appears/disappears — both shift row positions. Measuring browseHit (the redis.ts row center) mid-stream froze a coordinate that, once the frame was composited against the settled list, pointed at a different row (auth.ts). Waiting for .analysis-loading-inline to detach gives a stable list so the measured position and the captured frame agree. browseHit is also measured immediately before grabTree to eliminate any async-reorder gap.",
            "markdown": "Wait for analysis to settle before measuring the browse cursor target, so the composited cursor lands on the file the click actually opens.\n\nIn risk sort mode the sidebar re-sorts as mock scores stream in, and the `.analysis-loading-inline` banner appears/disappears — both shift row positions. Measuring `browseHit` (the `redis.ts` row center) mid-stream froze a coordinate that, once the frame was composited against the *settled* list, pointed at a different row (`auth.ts`). Waiting for `.analysis-loading-inline` to detach gives a stable list so the measured position and the captured frame agree. `browseHit` is also measured immediately before `grabTree` to eliminate any async-reorder gap."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "scripts/demo/capture-demo.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 362,
                  "endLine": 362,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "    await page.waitForSelector('.analysis-loading-inline', { state: 'detached', timeout: 20000 });"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "tags": [
              "rationale"
            ]
          },
